WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
A website wants a code.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.540
So you stop. Find your phone.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.500
Unlock it. Open the app.
Find the right account.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.360
Six digits. You read them. You type them.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.720
And they change.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.660
Or leave your phone on the table.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:17.840
Import your accounts once,

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.460
and yabbistir makes the same codes
right on your Mac.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.020
Shift, command, V.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.520
Pick the account. Press return.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.420
That's it. The code is in,
and you never even saw it.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.240
Your accounts stay in your Mac's Keychain.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.080
The extension can't reach the internet,

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.860
and no code is ever saved.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:42.740
Authenticator.
A free extension for yabbistir.
